Lowongan Kerja PT YTL Jawa Timur

MECHANICAL ENGINEER

- Holds a Bachelor’s Degree (S-1) or Diploma IV (D-4) in Mechanical Engineering from a reputable university;
- Possesses a minimum of 5 years of professional experience as Maintenance Engineer in coal handling / mining, power plant and other heavy industries;
- Strong expertise in preventive, predictive and corrective maintenance, as well as root cause analysis (RCA) for mechanical failures;

